&lt;p&gt;AUTOGRIP® Facing Heads are designed to enhance the efficiency and quality of mass-produced workpieces, particularly for outer and inner diameter boring tasks. These units are typically installed on special-purpose machines, where consistent performance and high precision are essential.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
